Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.08,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Haces de todo por quererte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:01.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y no consigues nada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.85,0:00:02.41,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Tu autoestima es como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:03.44,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}una batería y depende
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.27,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de lo que cargas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:05.39,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y de lo que descargas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:05.88,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Lo que la carga
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es escuchar lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:08.33,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}moverte y hacer ejercicio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:09.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}momentos de silencio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:10.39,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Cumplir con tu palabra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y lo que te prometes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.05,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y rodearte con gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.05,0:00:12.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que tenga ambición
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:13.29,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que te sume
