Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es tapar lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.41,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}fingir que dices que sí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:17.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cuando realmente quieres decir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:17.90,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:19.19,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}complacer depender siempre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:19.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que te elijan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:20.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que te den likes
